<div class="gallery-container">
  <div role="group" class="gallery no-js">
    <ul>
        <li role="listitem">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Phishing
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>Phishing is a broad term for an attack that involves tricking victims into sharing sensitive information such as passwords, usernames and credit card details for malicious reasons. A phishing attack can be random.</p>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/cs/cs_u2_s3_p1_slide1.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </li>
        <li role="listitem">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Spear-phishing
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>Spear phishing is a more sophisticated form of phishing and involves malicious emails being sent to a specific victim often for malicious reasons. The attacker will acquire personal information on the victim often via social media sites.</p>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/cs/cs_u2_s3_p1_slide2.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </li>
        <li role="listitem">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Vishing
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>Vishing or voice phishing is a form of phishing that involves phone calls. The victim will be approached via a call pertaining to be from a reputable source and told there is something wrong with an account and they need their details to sort it out.</p>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/cs/cs_u2_s3_p1_slide3.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </li>
        <li role="listitem">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Smishing
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>Smishing or SMSishing is a form of phishing that involves SMS text messaging. It may seem as though it has come from a trusted source and ask the victim to click on a link to update something.</p>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/cs/cs_u2_s3_p1_slide4.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

            
          
